urred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Assess Client Needs\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Client Needs' activity represents the initial evaluation phase where the social worker identifies and documents the specific needs and circumstances of a client.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Develop Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Service Plan' activity involves creating a structured plan outlining the services and interventions to be provided to the client based on the assessed needs.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Obtain Funding Approval' activity occurs, then a 'Provide Counseling Services' activity must eventually occur after the 'Obtain Funding Approval' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Obtain Funding Approval' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Provide Counseling Services' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Obtain Funding Approval' events. If 'Obtain Funding Approval' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Provide Counseling Services'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Obtain Funding Approval\",\"description\":\"The 'Obtain Funding Approval' activity represents the process of securing financial resources or approvals necessary to fund the services planned for the client.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Counseling Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Counseling Services' activity involves delivering therapeutic counseling sessions to the client, which may be individual, group, or family-based.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Provide Counseling Services' activity must be followed by a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Monitor Client Progress' event can occur only if a 'Provide Counseling Services' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Provide Counseling Services' imposes obligations for future 'Monitor Client Progress', and 'Monitor Client Progress' cannot occur without prior 'Provide Counseling Services'. Multiple 'Provide Counseling Services' and 'Monitor Client Progress' events are allowed, with each 'Provide Counseling Services' eventually leading to a 'Monitor Client Progress' and each 'Monitor Client Progress' being justified by a preceding 'Provide Counseling Services'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Provide Counseling Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Counseling Services' activity involves delivering therapeutic counseling sessions to the client, which may be individual, group, or family-based.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Client Progress\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Client Progress' activity involves regularly tracking and evaluating the client's advancement toward the goals outlined in the service plan.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Adjust Service Plan' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, a 'Monitor Client Progress' event cannot be immediately preceded by an 'Adjust Service Plan' event. This constraint allows multiple occurrences of 'Adjust Service Plan' and 'Monitor Client Progress' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Adjust Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Adjust Service Plan' activity represents the modification of the existing service plan in response to the client's progress, setbacks, or newly identified needs.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Client Progress\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Client Progress' activity involves regularly tracking and evaluating the client's advancement toward the goals outlined in the service plan.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Assess Client Needs' activity occurs and the activation condition 'A.Client Risk Level is High' is satisfied, then a 'Conduct Home Visit' activity must eventually occur after the 'Assess Client Needs' event at some point in the same process instance, within a time frame between 0 and 24 hours. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Assess Client Needs' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Conduct Home Visit' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Assess Client Needs' events. If 'Assess Client Needs' does not occur or the activation condition is not met, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Conduct Home Visit'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Assess Client Needs\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Client Needs' activity represents the initial evaluation phase where the social worker identifies and documents the specific needs and circumstances of a client.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Home Visit\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Home Visit' activity involves visiting the client's home to assess their living conditions and gather contextual information relevant to their service plan.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Client Risk Level is High\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity occurs and the activation condition 'A.Progress Score < 50' is satisfied, then an 'Adjust Service Plan' activity must eventually occur after the 'Monitor Client Progress' event at some point in the same process instance, within a time frame between 0 and 7 days. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Monitor Client Progress' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Adjust Service Plan' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Monitor Client Progress' events. If 'Monitor Client Progress' does not occur or the activation condition is not met, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Adjust Service Plan'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Client Progress\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Client Progress' activity involves regularly tracking and evaluating the client's advancement toward the goals outlined in the service plan.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Adjust Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Adjust Service Plan' activity represents the modification of the existing service plan in response to the client's progress, setbacks, or newly identified needs.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Progress Score < 50\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,7,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Develop Service Plan' activity occurs and the activation condition 'A.Service Plan Duration > 6' is satisfied, then a 'Refer to Specialist' activity must eventually occur after the 'Develop Service Plan' event at some point in the same process instance, within a time frame between 0 and 30 days. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Develop Service Plan' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Refer to Specialist' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Develop Service Plan' events. If 'Develop Service Plan' does not occur or the activation condition is not met, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Refer to Specialist'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Service Plan' activity involves creating a structured plan outlining the services and interventions to be provided to the client based on the assessed needs.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Refer to Specialist\",\"description\":\"The 'Refer to Specialist' activity involves directing the client to a specialized professional, such as a psychiatrist, addiction counselor, or legal aid provider, for targeted assistance.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Service Plan Duration > 6\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,30,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Conduct Home Visit' activity occurs and the activation condition 'A.Home Visit Outcome is Negative' is satisfied, then an 'Adjust Service Plan' activity must eventually occur after the 'Conduct Home Visit' event at some point in the same process instance, within a time frame between 0 and 3 days. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Conduct Home Visit' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Adjust Service Plan' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Conduct Home Visit' events. If 'Conduct Home Visit' does not occur or the activation condition is not met, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Adjust Service Plan'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Home Visit\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Home Visit' activity involves visiting the client's home to assess their living conditions and gather contextual information relevant to their service plan.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Adjust Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Adjust Service Plan' activity represents the modification of the existing service plan in response to the client's progress, setbacks, or newly identified needs.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Home Visit Outcome is Negative\",\"correlatio